动作变化应该以主体的变化为主，需要详细描述，\n\n5、每段提示词与下一段提示司，不要分行，不要有空隔，这个必须严格执行。\n\n例如提示词展示：\n图像1：真人摄景风格，场景篮球场边缘跑道、活力四射运动系女生，五官精致，红棕羊毛卷扎低马尾甩动感弧度，动态快照风格保留肌肉线条流畅美感\n图像2：CG风格，场景放学街角便利店前、清透肌肤大眼美人，法式刘海+银灰色挑染，侧耳微笑眨眼，穿着学院风针织开衫搭配牛仔短裤，背景霓虹灯牌模糊成梦幻光轨，\n图像3：动漫风格，巨型章鱼机器人缠绕电线杆向上攀爬，八条腕足交替发力撕扯金属结构，眼睛发出幽绿脉冲信号，", "images", 24, 256, 840452769282678, "randomize", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 30, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "label": "system_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_mode"}, "name": "inference_mode", "label": "inference_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "inference_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_frames"}, "name": "max_frames", "label": "max_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_frames"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_size"}, "name": "max_size", "label": "max_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "force_offload"}, "name": "force_offload", "label": "force_offload", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "force_offload"}, {"widget": {"name": "save_states"}, "name": "save_states", "label": "save_states", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "save_states"